Q: How to make a song loop/how to make a loop command A: <p>Firstly, you need to set up a queue system.</p>

<p>Secondly, once a music queue is completed/finished, just shift the queue and it will play the very same music again.</p>

<p>Thirdly, to create a loop command, just place the shift method inside a command.</p>

<p>For example:</p>

<pre><code>if (message.content === 'loop') {
